      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你拥有冷静分析状况的眼光——\n呵呵，是个足够优秀的训练员呢。……对了，你的担当是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f665123427e2b44cc14b7af40d51dbe0fc88f5ba07650c2dd08b2901c79375e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
