      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是吗？　不过……这样啊，稍微有点意外呢。\n你也是从现在才刚刚开始起步呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3336029599eea1285345a80a84a1eddcb9db958ae8affa949ce53c9e618682b5",
