      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对呀……你的训练员生涯，还有我通往女王的道路，\n全都要从现在开始。啊……真是让人兴奋不已呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d40329862dae22a79b609cc917672f64f119fd39d6dcaae504c0ffdac0f63da1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1112/storytimeline_041112002.json",
      "json_path": [
