      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我必须多训练哪怕1秒，多长哪怕1克的肌肉。\n无论是饮食，还是生活，我愿意为了胜利献出一切！",
      "source_fingerprint": "420598f2f394251122116d80def33673ead9ccc6c2e721bede318e4437e8701a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
