    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b98e383f6bda46fe5b085b29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她所讲述的并非梦想……而是即将到来的，关于未来的事实。\n――那份强烈的气魄，深深地震撼了我的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7477333a392ef60ca9bb1b0b21a2b327f46e2e02a9b46edd1f82ef87cfa92765",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
