      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了，刚好告一段落，今天就到此为止吧。\n你太会倾听了……害我一不小心就激动起来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa873577292446a5433fad7f3c18265338812cb9779299004aa2b42a0aa729b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
